hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2715","###
 Abdullah bin Sa'id al-Ashaj narrated to us, saying: Abu Khalid narrated to us, informing me that Ubaydullah narrated from Nafi', who said: ""I saw Ibn Umar (RA) touch the Black Stone with his hand, then kiss his hand, and he said: 'I have not left this action since I saw the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) doing it.'"" This hadith was also narrated to us by Abu Kurayb, who said: Abu Khalid narrated to us, stating that Abdullah"
